title: "Equity Direction Prediction under Multiple-Testing Controls"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Project contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python research system for testing whether short-horizon
  equity direction signals survive leakage controls, realistic execution
  assumptions, out-of-sample validation, and multiple-testing corrections.
keywords:
  - quantitative finance
  - backtesting
  - multiple testing
  - leakage prevention
  - negative results
